// Sentry configuration for the minit app target.
// The DSN is injected into Info.plist (key SentryDSN) via $(SENTRY_DSN).
// xcconfig treats "//" as a comment, hence the $() split in the URL.
// A DSN is a public client key (it only allows sending events), so it is
// safe to keep in the repo. Leave SENTRY_DSN empty to disable Sentry.
SENTRY_DSN = https:/$()/3949c3290b20bc30ee6f81365ed29931@o4512249783844864.ingest.de.sentry.io/4512249879068752

// SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT is set by Development.xcconfig, Internal.xcconfig, and
// Release.xcconfig after this include. Leaving it unset here keeps a value in
// this file from putting development back.
